dotengine/godot/issues/115947","id":3865194927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mYjGv","user":{"login":"KCeple77","id":52489126,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDg5MTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52489126?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77","html_url":"https://github.com/KCeple77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KCeple77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T19:58:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T12:00:31Z","body":"In EditorNode::edit_item, there is a loop iterating over plugins. It first makes_visible AnimationTree, and then AnimationPlayer, from what I can see. Currently experimenting with it\n\nVector<EditorPlugin *> available_plugins = editor_data.get_handling_sub_editors(p_object); -> this returns AnimationTree and AnimationPlayer as plugins which can handle this Animation p_object. And then they are both made visible.\nIt's the to_over_edit loop.\n\nUltimately, the fix you've done says that AnimationTree is not visible so it goes ahead and makes the AnimationPlayer visible instead:\nEditorNode::edit_item name=65\n_plugin_over_edit 64\nAnimationTreeEditorPlugin::make_visible, p_visible=1\nEditorDock::make_visible\n_plugin_over_edit 64\nAnimationPlayerEditorPlugin::make_visible\nAPlayer ptr=0x638fcc669db0\nATree: visible=0, parent_visible_in_tree=1\nEditorDock::make_visible\n\nI will experiment some more today/tomorrow to see why that is the case","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865194927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3869664806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115947#issuecomment-3869664806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115947","id":3869664806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mpmYm","user":{"login":"ndbn","id":2904562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDQ1NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2904562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn","html_url":"https://github.com/ndbn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T06:37:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T06:37:43Z","body":"Guess it is same issue but history of recently edited objects works same\n\n<img width=\"272\" height=\"219\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b9bb37d-b869-47b3-af8e-ba14edb04e04\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3869664806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"